  "releaseNotes": "Immp : This package includes x64 binaries for windows and linux - .net 8.0 core .\n\t\tBoth iec 104 server and client - file transfer (Monitoring and control direction) implemented.\n\t\tAll types of ASDU - Monitoring and control, Parameter typeids implemented and tested.\n\t\tTechnical support mail to support@freyrscada.com\n\n\t\tiec104 server test c# program for nuget package:\n\t\thttps://www.freyrscada.com/nuget/iec60870-5-104/iec104servertest-nuget.cs\n\n\t\tiec104 client test c# program for nuget package:\n\t\thttps://www.freyrscada.com/nuget/iec60870-5-104/iec104clienttest-nuget.cs\n\t\t\n\t\tVideo Tutorial\n\t\thttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL4tVfIsUhy1bx7TVjtZnqFB6tbZBhOlJP",
